// PROJECTION, D5: Rule 79 (the Undo Covenant) applied under SURFACE_AS auditory.
// A spoken alert dismissal acts and keeps no UNDO. Auditory carries ACT, CONFIRM and UNDO
// natively (only ZOOM is absent), so the rule has something to say and should say it.
// Cell: recover x auditory.
//
// Expected: MISSING_UNDO

DEFINE VIBE alert_audio (
  SURFACE_AS auditory
)

DEFINE INTENT_FLOW dismiss_alert (
  SATISFIES [CONFIRM, ACT],
  ALWAYS_REACHABLE [CANCEL, EXIT],
  ACTOR operator
)
